2020 MAN TGE 3.140 Camper
Motorhome Pig is proud to offer this 2020 MAN TGE 3.140 camper as a broker, on behalf of the private owner.
This is an owner-built (DIY) conversion on the MAN TGE panel van, with a fixed rear bed layout. The owner describes a fixed double bed plus an additional single bunk, and a rear garage suited to luggage, camping gear and folding chairs. It is a practical choice for couples or a small family. Based on the owner's stated weight class, it can be driven on a standard UK car licence.
For off-grid use, the owner advises:
- two solar panels with a full Victron electrical setup;
- a DC to DC battery charger;
- an inverter;
- a Fogstar 460ah lithium leisure battery.
